= Valentine de Saint-Point

France's first female futurist and the head of Collège Idéiste.

- @organizing_women
- @toleration
- @root: Return to main

@organizing_women
title: Organizing women
subtitle: De Saint-Point's strategies are aimed at more "traditional" women.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

De Saint-Point's strategies for organizing women are aimed at working-class housewives, and acknowledge women's traditional household roles. We argue that our economic welfare programs will improve the livelihoods of women and their families.

[? if spd_r < 50 : Unfortunately, women still disproportionately support the bourgeois parties. ?]

@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: De Saint-Point supports cooperation with the bourgeois parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_toleration: The SPD is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions.
